\clipboard {GO}{GO: To develop and evaluate an IoT-based system for trucks, in 
collaboration with the partner truck company Hino Parañaque Subic GS Auto Inc.
 (SGSA), that monitors real-time fuel levels, tracks routes using GPS, and dete
cts unusual fuel consumption using machine learning, with the goal of improving
 driver safety, supporting rest scheduling, and facilitating proactive vehicle 
maintenance through automated alerts using fuel and distance metrics, based on 
established service guidelines.}
